# Smoke test for pc_resource (PC system stats via raw HTTP GET to a
# local sensor server). The WiFiClient stub now reads
# test/fixtures/socket/0.0.0.0.txt as the canned reply (default
# pc_ipaddr is "0.0.0.0"), so on the first wait the
# doDelayMillisTime tick fires WIFI_CONN -> get_pc_resource_data ->
# parse, and the follow-up `action UP` rerenders display_pc_resource
# with CPU 45% / 65°C / GPU 35% / RAM 50% etc.

app pc_resource

wait_ms 1200
action UP
screenshot 01_with_data
assert_no_crash

action RETURN
wait_ms 200
assert_no_crash
